# Riparo

Riparo monitors npm dependency advisories, applies the smallest safe fix, verifies with no-mistakes, and opens a focused security PR.

It is not a general Dependabot replacement for all ecosystems. npm first.

## Current phase

This repo is a scaffold.
Implement behind `--dry-run`.
Do not claim working scan, patch, verify, or PR behavior until the matching stub actually does the work.

Read `README.md` before expanding scope.

Prefer the smallest diff.
Do not invent config formats, config keys, or package names until asked.

## Commands and modules

Commands and modules map 1:1:

| Command | Module |
|---------|--------|
| `scan` | `src/scan/` |
| `patch` | `src/patch/` |
| `verify` | `src/verify/` |
| `pr` | `src/pr/` |

Keep `src/cli.ts` as a thin argument router.

## Verification

[no-mistakes](https://github.com/kunchenguid/no-mistakes) is the verification gate for “the patch worked and the PR is clean”.
Do not reimplement that pipeline.

Never push to origin as part of an agent task.
Verification goes through no-mistakes when that path exists.
